    <string name="about_text">
z.TextGrab is an offline Optical Character Recognition (OCR) tool designed for simplicity, speed, and accessibility. The app can convert text from images and PDFs into editable, searchable content in just a few taps.

• Works Offline: All OCR happens on your device—no internet required.

• Multi-Language Support: Recognize text in multiple languages at once.

• PDF &amp; Image OCR: Extract text from single images or entire PDFs page by page.

• Accessibility Friendly: Built with TalkBack support for seamless use by everyone.

• Save &amp; Share: Store results as text files or copy them instantly.

With z.TextGrab, your text is always private, always available, and always in your control.
</string>



